# Document collections

Group documents by the task or equipment family people are working on, not by file type. List only documents that exist. The shared limits for every page template are on [Page templates](index.html).

## When to use it

Use it for manuals, maintenance guidance or release documentation. Give the collection a focused title and a short description. Add enough item context to tell similar titles apart.

## Structure and behaviour

Give each group a heading and a list of document links, and add a contents list when several groups make the page long. Show format and revision at item level where it helps, and describe formats accurately ([WG-064](../../content/formatting-content/attachments.html#wg-064)). Mark archived and superseded documents. Keep a route from each document back to its collection, without implying it belongs to only one.

## Home Assistant boundary

This template does not upload private documents or subscribe people to updates. Only list material meant for the current audience. Do not replace a missing document with a clickable placeholder, and do not advertise a downloadable bundle that has not been built.

